        "created_at": "2013-04-03T21:01:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd've thought Fixed Point was another Cataclysm one, since it's a fixed point in time. Tendrils of Madness struck me as being more of a Discord thing - it's a weird, wibbly thing, after all. And not all Discord cards have to be Distortions - remember there's the portal fiends, bubbles, and other stuff as well.</p>",
